<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Wednesday it would issue T$5 billion in one-month negotiable certificates of deposit later in the day.</p>
<p>Bids would close at 15.00 local time (0700 GMT), a central bank official said.  </p>
<p>The central bank has said its recent series of NCD issues aimed to absorb excess liquidity in banking system and was not explicitly intended to dampen stock market turnover as many analysts have asserted.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
